---
source: crates/surveyor/src/app/cli_args.rs
expression: output
---
surveyor x.y.z
Version a Cargo repo from git tags and conventional commits, and render release
notes

Usage: surveyor [--log-level <LOG_LEVEL>] <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  notes    Render release notes for the commits since the last release.
  version  Determine the version from git tags and commits, and write it into
           `Cargo.toml` and `Cargo.lock`.
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Flags:
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>  Set the log level.
                               [possible values: error, warn, info, debug,
                               trace]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
